tions as of September 30, 2025 and 2024, respectively. The Company does not expect that its assessment regarding unrecognized tax positions will materially change over the next 12 months.","context":"The Macau income tax is recognized based on the results for the year, as adjusted for items that are non-assessable or disallowed. It is calculated using tax rates that have been enacted or substantively enacted by the balance sheet date.","section":"Business combination","block":120,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-043473","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-09-21","reportDate":"2026-09-21","cik":"0002011458","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2011458/000149315226043473/ex99-1.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/24fe08ed5576a454376a6f04f6265114fadcc6bf7bf0916a9ad42c55a9db2c3c.bin","sha256":"24fe08ed5576a454376a6f04f6265114fadcc6bf7bf0916a9ad42c55a9db2c3c"}}],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"operatingKpis":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"managementExplanations":{"status":"evidence_available","evidence":[{"id":"2edc753573c65cdf188d255a654501aee6cc189592079c96db9dd3dade719637","quote":"| | For the Years Ended September 30, | | | 2025 | | | 2024 | Other income | | | | | | | | Interest income | | $ | 1 | | | $ | - | Total other income | | $ | 1 | | | $ | - | | | | | | | | | Expenses | | | | | | | | Allowance for credit losses | | $ | 36,763 | | | $ | - | Communications and technology | | | 20,165 | | | | 18,586 | Compensation and benefits | | | 11,209 | | | | - | Depreciation | | | 114 | | | | - | Other administrative expenses | | | 5,281 | | | | 3,481 | Total expenses | | $ | 73,532 | | | $ | 22,067 | | | | | | | | | Loss before income taxes | | $ | (73,531 | ) | | $ | (22,067 | ) Provision for income taxes | | | - | | | | - | Net loss | | $ | (73,531 | ) | | $ | (22,067 | ) | | | | | | | | Net loss attributable to: | | | | | | | | Shareholder